@startuml
title Executable BPMN 2.0.2 to canonical workflow mapping
left to right direction
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false

package "Accepted structured SESE BPMN" <<dialect>> {
  class Definitions
  class Process
  class NoneStartEnd
  class ServiceOrLocalTask
  class SequenceFlow
  class ExclusiveGateway
  class ParallelGateway
  class SequentialMultiInstance {
    loopCardinality: static non-negative integer
  }
}
package "Canonical workflow" <<IR>> {
  class WorkflowRoot
  class TaskNode
  class Sequence
  class Exclusive
  class Parallel
  class RepeatCount
  class RoutingEntry
}
package "Rejected with source diagnostic" {
  class Unsupported {
    unstructured or multiple processes
    graph cycles
    unsupported events or gateways
    standardLoopCharacteristics
    parallel multi-instance
    dynamic loop cardinality
  }
}

Definitions --> Process : exactly one executable process
Process --> WorkflowRoot : structured lowering
NoneStartEnd --> WorkflowRoot : boundaries
ServiceOrLocalTask --> TaskNode : resolves to Application task
SequenceFlow --> Sequence : structured order
SequenceFlow --> RoutingEntry : overlay target
ExclusiveGateway --> Exclusive
ParallelGateway --> Parallel
SequentialMultiInstance --> RepeatCount
Unsupported -[#black,dashed]-> WorkflowRoot : never approximated
@enduml
